  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.81 “Practical examination evaluator training and education (PEETE) program” means the training program developed by the division, which all BLS and ALS practical examination evaluators must complete.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
